     <abstract pn="section-abstract">
+      <t indent="0" pn="section-abstract-1">It has been brought to my attention that the following sentence
+should be added to the Very Distant Host specification in Appendix F of
+BBN report 1822, Specifications for the Interconnection of a Host and an
+IMP, to the paragraph beginning on page F-5 and ending on page F-7:</t>
+      <t indent="0" pn="section-abstract-2">"Null packets do not use a channel (nor a channel number) when sent and
+are not acknowledged when received."</t>
+      <t indent="0" pn="section-abstract-3">Please file this RFC with your copy of BBN report 1822 until 1822
+is next updated.</t>
